        "hero_tag": "Seoul Glow Lab",
        "hero_title": "Our Story",
        "hero_desc": "Built from a love of Korean skincare, a frustration with the noise around it, and a belief that shopping for your skin should feel informed, not overwhelming.",
        "mission_title": "Our Mission",
        "mission_text": "<p>To make Korean skincare easier to understand, more thoughtful to shop, and more personal to experience.</p><p>Through education, intentional curation, and real guidance, we help people understand their skin, make more informed choices, and discover Korean beauty without the overwhelm.</p>",
        "mission_image": "shopify://shop_images/SeoulGlowLabOpening-51.png",
        "values_title": "What We Stand For",
        "values_desc": "The principles that guide everything we do",
        "founder_title": "The Heart Behind Seoul Glow Lab",
        "founder_text": "<p>I didn't think skincare needed another store. I thought it needed a better way to shop.</p><p>Before Seoul Glow Lab, I was the person constantly researching skincare, trying products, reading ingredient lists, and becoming increasingly obsessed with Korean beauty. What drew me in wasn't just the products. It was the innovation, the formulations, and an industry that seemed willing to keep asking, <em>what can we do differently?</em></p><p>But the deeper I went, the more overwhelming it became. There were thousands of products, endless opinions, viral ingredients, and very few places where you could actually slow down, ask questions, and understand what made sense for <strong>your</strong> skin.</p><p>So I built the place I wished existed.</p><p>Seoul Glow Lab began as a Korean skincare store, but from the beginning, the bigger idea was education, access, and discovery. We curate intentionally, ask a lot of questions, and keep learning from the dermatologists, cosmetic chemists, formulators, brand teams, educators, and innovators shaping this industry.</p><p>And as SGL grows, so does that mission. We're continuing to build new ways for consumers and skincare professionals to learn, connect, and get closer to the innovation coming out of Korea.</p><p>Because the goal was never to tell you what to buy. It's to help you understand enough to decide for yourself.</p><p>— Katie Hernandez, <em>Founder</em></p>",
        "founder_image": "shopify://shop_images/SeoulGlowLabOpening-39.jpg",
        "store_title": "Visit Our Flagship Store",
        "store_text": "<p>Experience Seoul Glow Lab in person at our flagship location in Kearny Mesa, San Diego. Get personalized skincare consultations and discover exclusive in-store collections.</p>",
